    "Name": "Hobgoblin II HOBII-A",
    "Details": "The A configuration of the Hobgoblin II OmniProtoMech mounts an LRM-14 launcher, which lets it perform most fire-support missions. The launcher carries enough ammunition for a long period of constant fire, after which the configuration has to rely on its backup Machine Gun. A Magnetic Clamp System lets it ride into battle on friendly 'Mechs, such as fast medium OmniMechs or assault OmniMechs like the Gatekeeper, despite its slow ground speed.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: OmniProtoMech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.978</color></b>",
    "Icon": "Protomech_Gorgon"
